561
00:53:47.829 --> 00:53:49.296
<i>What are you doing?</i>

562
00:53:50.263 --> 00:53:52.965
<i>Sweetheart, stop that.</i>
<i>Stop it.</i>

563
00:53:52.967 --> 00:53:57.368
<i>Say, "It's my birthday, Mommy</i>
<i>and I love you."</i>

564
00:53:57.370 --> 00:54:00.271
<i>Hold on one second.</i>
<i>Hold still.</i>

565
00:54:00.273 --> 00:54:02.975
<i>Do you love me?</i>
<i>Say, "I love you, Mommy."</i>

566
00:54:02.977 --> 00:54:05.913
